      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.71,
      "end_seconds": 13.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.39,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.49,
      "end_seconds": 17.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "It's no real problems, mostly."
